 "lab": {
  "title": "VPN между офисами (GRE + IPsec)",
  "text": "Главный офис (HQ, 203.0.113.2) и филиал (BRANCH, 203.0.113.6) выходят в интернет. Частные сети 192.168.1.0/24 и 192.168.2.0/24 пока не видят друг друга.\n\n1. Создайте между маршрутизаторами GRE-туннель Tunnel0 (10.255.0.0/30).\n2. Защитите его IPsec: ISAKMP-политика с ключом `Vpn-2026`, transform-set и `tunnel protection ipsec profile`.\n3. Направьте сеть другого офиса в туннель и проверьте связь между ПК.",
  "checks": [
   "ping PC-HQ 192.168.2.10 | Офисы связаны через VPN",
   "ping HQ 10.255.0.2 | Туннель поднят"
  ],
  "translations": {
   "en": {
    "title": "Site-to-site VPN (GRE + IPsec)",
    "text": "The head office (HQ, 203.0.113.2) and the branch (BRANCH, 203.0.113.6) are on the Internet. Their private networks 192.168.1.0/24 and 192.168.2.0/24 cannot reach each other yet.\n\n1. Build a GRE tunnel Tunnel0 between the routers (10.255.0.0/30).\n2. Protect it with IPsec: an ISAKMP policy with the key `Vpn-2026`, a transform set and `tunnel protection ipsec profile`.\n3. Route the other office's network into the tunnel and test PC to PC.",
    "checks": [
     "The offices are connected through the VPN",
     "The tunnel is up"
    ]
   }
  },
  "script": {
   "HQ": "enable\nconfigure terminal\ncrypto isakmp policy 10\nencryption aes 256\nauthentication pre-share\ngroup 14\nexit\ncrypto isakmp key Vpn-2026 address 203.0.113.6\ncrypto ipsec transform-set TS esp-aes 256 esp-sha-hmac\nexit\ncrypto ipsec profile VPN\nset transform-set TS\nexit\ninterface tunnel 0\nip address 10.255.0.1 255.255.255.252\ntunnel source gi0/1\ntunnel destination 203.0.113.6\ntunnel protection ipsec profile VPN\nexit\nip route 192.168.2.0 255.255.255.0 Tunnel0\nend",
   "BRANCH": "enable\nconfigure terminal\ncrypto isakmp policy 10\nencryption aes 256\nauthentication pre-share\ngroup 14\nexit\ncrypto isakmp key Vpn-2026 address 203.0.113.2\ncrypto ipsec transform-set TS esp-aes 256 esp-sha-hmac\nexit\ncrypto ipsec profile VPN\nset transform-set TS\nexit\ninterface tunnel 0\nip address 10.255.0.2 255.255.255.252\ntunnel source gi0/1\ntunnel destination 203.0.113.2\ntunnel protection ipsec profile VPN\nexit\nip route 192.168.1.0 255.255.255.0 Tunnel0\nend"
  }
 }
}